    "name": "ZenML OSS REST Artifacts Stacks API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for the ZenML server, exposing operations to manage pipelines, stacks, components, artifacts, models, deployments, runs, schedules, secrets, users, projects, and triggers in a self-hosted ZenML deployment. The API is consumed by the ZenML Python SDK and CLI and can also be called directly for automation and CI/CD integration.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ZenML",
